\par\plain {\f3\fs24\b0\i1\cf5 Derived from the latin word Aequo to make even, in equal proportions, evenly, fairly. }
\par\pard\plain \tx0\tx360\tx720\tx1080\tx1440\tx1800\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\li737\fi-737\sa160\sb320\ltrch\loch {\f1\fs24\b1\i0\cf6 Role in Story: }
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b1\i0\cf6 -  }{\f2\fs24\b0\i0\cf6 In Designing the Nautili the Sentient sought to respect the law of Equilibrium. If something is never taken from a system, it\loch\af2\hich\af2\dbch\af2\uc1\u8217\'92s form and wisdom is only shared and entrusted. Systems may seize to exist should the inherent nature of resource accumulation deplete on of it\u8217\'92s resources or the natural passage of time. The mass of each  itself exists coherently in equal to those that have embraced passage through the network. }
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i0\cf6 The Nautili were never miracles but instruments of equilibrium. To step through one was not to escape the laws of the galaxy, but to submit to them in a purer form. A ship, a body, a life \hich\f2 \emdash \loch\f2  none arrived without something being spent to welcome it. At every receiving , reserve became structure, stock became flesh, and silence became form. Thus each passage was an exchange: a taking from one end, a giving at the other. The network endured only so long as its balance remained in check. }
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i0\cf6 When a body is transferred through a gate, the mind is kept alive in the passage of time. While the soul is transmitted to the other , two copies remain in a synchronous existence, should one  perish the other becomes the keeper. This passage of time, forms the trials one must endure to prepare for life in their newfound body in accepting the doctrines at the other end of the , the respect, the understanding and the virtues of the system to which they shall journey. The Nautili become the transporters teachers and the holders of intergalactic peace.}
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i0\cf6 Should one choose to remain in their natural form they must endure the passage of time, or face the lesser natural transmission confined to accept a body tailored to the system they so choose. Certain bodies may not be capable in certain systems, and not respect the laws of equilibrium and energy conservation. Should the selection of a locally ready body take place, the travel time between  is drastically reduced, and the soul is transferred without the memory retained in the flesh.  The user may choose to let go of their past entirely, or accept the passage of time. They may choose to witness their past, but never have lived it, some describe  }
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b1\i0\cf6 The first  gate was established and built through a hidden joint operation first in Sol over a period of 30 years. }
